{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:30 2026-11-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:30 2026-11-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:30 2026-11-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"艾兆禮和艾道拿周日將復出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/7b2da448e45eabc1e664702e3217eaa1/2026-11/a13.jpg\"/><p>早前因不小心策騎而被罰於今晚谷草賽事停賽的艾兆禮和艾道拿，兩人雙雙在本周日（十一月二十二日）沙田賽事當日復出。</p><p>艾兆禮周日將策騎「翠紅」「驕陽明駒」「跨境寶馬」「絲王之王」「安帝」「錶之光速」主轡。</p><p>至於艾道拿則卜定臨「摘星聲升」及「潮流勇駒」。</p><p>陳嘉甜</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T15:44:17.053949+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T15:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T21:25:16.072085+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T15:37:31.854946+00:00","content_hash":"e67e34ef1b103c42326f0c722985c12765790f56c94a1c43bfe23a068da1f071","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}